flowchart LR
    A[yfinance crypto prices] --> B[Close / adjusted close frame]
    B --> C[Daily log returns]
    C --> D[Annualized drift vector]
    C --> E[Annualized covariance matrix]

    D --> F[Monte Carlo GBM simulation]
    E --> F
    G[Random seed] --> F

    F --> H[Simulated asset paths]
    H --> I[Normalize each asset to starting value 1.0]
    I --> J[Apply custom portfolio weights]
    J --> K[Portfolio simulation paths]

    K --> L[Terminal portfolio distribution]
    L --> M[Expected return %]
    L --> N[Probability of loss]
    L --> O[P10 / P50 / P90]

    K --> P[portfolio_paths.png]
    L --> Q[terminal_value_distribution.png]
    M --> R[metrics.json]
    N --> R
    O --> R
    R --> S[summary.md]